{
  "statement": "I appreciate the focus on safety, compliance, and security, but performance efficiency is crucial for user satisfaction. I propose a synthesis where we retain EFF-01 and EFF-02 to ensure responsiveness and throughput while modifying SAF-02 to allow automatic fund withdrawals without compromising efficiency. This modification can include a clause that ensures withdrawals are processed swiftly while still adhering to safety and compliance standards. Additionally, I suggest incorporating energy efficiency metrics into EFF-01 and EFF-02 to balance performance with sustainability goals. I oppose dropping any of my requirements as they are essential for maintaining high performance in the ATM system.",
